 "content": "Releases are cut by running `make release`, which creates the release tag and publishes. This replaces the earlier process of hand-pushing a `vYYYY.MM.N` git tag for CI to pick up. Do not tag or publish by hand. As of 2026-10-01 the checked-in Makefile only had `test` and `test-fast` targets and no `release` target, so confirm the target exists before relying on it."
}
